{"2495090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Traces: Genesis", "steam_appid": 2495090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/83aa54d9c8c081f04ec4cc14a5f8e2d2.avif?t=1785954005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras_big/83aa54d9c8c081f04ec4cc14a5f8e2d2.webp?t=1785954005 width=1560 height=363 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost Traces: Genesis</strong> is the full, commercial continuation of the psychic horror saga, picking up immediately after the chilling events of the <i>False Awakening</i> Demo. Step into the shoes of Evelyn Strom as her personal descent into a family nightmare escalates into a <strong>global conspiracy</strong> against the mysterious organizations and the ultimate secret of her <strong>GENESIS</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story-rich, first-person psychological horror game built for the next generation of tension and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/6914974b0aa773bf046c2c12cd25c80d.poster.avif?t=1785954005\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/6914974b0aa773bf046c2c12cd25c80d.webm?t=1785954005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/6914974b0aa773bf046c2c12cd25c80d.mp4?t=1785954005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/387fef1c740bf1ac1e50b66369217e4b.avif?t=1785954005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras_big/387fef1c740bf1ac1e50b66369217e4b.webp?t=1785954005 width=1560 height=363 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the demo was a glimpse, <strong>Genesis</strong> is the full chronicle. Prepare for a significantly expanded narrative that delves into the origins and consequences of the conspiracy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of Deep Lore:</strong> Piece together a complex mystery through fully <strong>voice-acted dialogue</strong>, detailed documents, and environmental storytelling that weaves together a tapestry of psychic power and inherited trauma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consequence of Choice:</strong> Every action taken in your investigation brings you closer to a terrifying truth, influencing the narrative as you face down the entity that haunts Evelyn and the conspirators who control the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/1b05ce59e629c95eabf7791c37376a24.poster.avif?t=1785954005\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/1b05ce59e629c95eabf7791c37376a24.webm?t=1785954005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/1b05ce59e629c95eabf7791c37376a24.mp4?t=1785954005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/aac1db5e126e15df7662021e6f8cec71.avif?t=1785954005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras_big/aac1db5e126e15df7662021e6f8cec71.webp?t=1785954005 width=1560 height=363 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next-Gen Atmosphere:</strong> Built on the stability and visual power of <strong>UE 5.4</strong>, we deliver dramatically enhanced volumetric lighting, <strong>deeper shadows</strong>, and hyper-realistic environments that create unparalleled tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/d821b76791a07a4a6083c3d3a2a17c66.poster.avif?t=1785954005\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/d821b76791a07a4a6083c3d3a2a17c66.webm?t=1785954005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/d821b76791a07a4a6083c3d3a2a17c66.mp4?t=1785954005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/44135722dfbea3b83f3eb23cd98cb0f8.avif?t=1785954005\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras_big/44135722dfbea3b83f3eb23cd98cb0f8.webp?t=1785954005 width=1560 height=363 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolved Psychic Toolkit:</strong> Evelyn’s unique <strong>psychic powers</strong> are your most vital tool. Use them to see into the past, reveal hidden paths, and <strong>solve complex environmental puzzles</strong> that bridge the gap between two realities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Adventure Horror Experience:</strong> Gameplay emphasizes <strong>exploration and Investigation</strong>. Track key documents, manage resources, and master the art of searching and investigating. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/9a0cac9ffca2fba58256d4ade5911efd.poster.avif?t=1785954005\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/9a0cac9ffca2fba58256d4ade5911efd.webm?t=1785954005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495090/extras/9a0cac9ffca2fba58256d4ade5911efd.mp4?t=1785954005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Content &amp; Genre Tags</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lost Traces: Genesis</i> is an intense, mature psychological horror experience. Players should expect the following content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Psychological Horror, Survival Horror, Story Rich, Exploration, Conspiracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content:</strong> Strong language, intense fear, depictions of violence and blood (non-combat), mature themes, and unsettling atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Wishlist Now &amp; Stay Connected</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost Traces: Genesis</strong> is currently deep in development. Wishlisting the game is the single most important way to support us and ensures you receive the latest updates, trailers, and the official launch date announcement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the community discussion and share your excitement!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets